  // TurnEnd/SessionEnd make the CLI read a transcript; without a session
  // ref it reports "transcript file not specified". The bridge payload
  // carries only the session id, so resolve the DSH session file here,
  // where ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT is known. A session launched from a parent
  // directory of the repository has no slug under the repo workspace, so
  // the lookup falls back to scanning session headers by id.
